   "fairsharingRecord": "FAIRsharing.mye76w",
   "fairsharingMatch": "confirmed",
   "note": "Research 5 Oct 2026 (medium confidence): The describing paper is Visser et al., BMC Bioinformatics, online 2011-06-24. Schürer et al., J Biomol Screen, April 2011 (doi:10.1177/1087057111400191) already used BAO. bioassayontology.org linked BAO on NCBO BioPortal by 2011-02-03 (web capture), while the May 2010 site and wiki were login-only. I kept year precision because the public BioPortal release may be late 2010. FAIRsharing year 2009 is the NHGRI grant/project start. Releases continue on GitHub (BAO 2.8.19, 2026). URL changed to https. Verified 5 Oct 2026: datePublished changed (The archived NCBO BioPortal BAO page (https://web.archive.org/web/20110703074549/http://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/1533) lists version 0.9.461 with release date 09/17/2010 and a public download link. Its BioPortal id is 44531, the exact version that Visser et al. 2011 cite as 'available online at the NCBO bioportal http://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/44531'. BAO was therefore public in Sept 2010, before both 2011 papers.) Verified 5 Oct 2026: dateBasis changed (The earliest date is now the first public BioPortal release (v0.9.461, 2010-09-17), not the June 2011 paper.) Verified 5 Oct 2026: dateSource changed (This capture's 'Versions' table shows 0.9.461 released 09/17/2010.) Proposed 9 Oct 2026: An OWL ontology giving controlled, identified terms and qualified relations for describing bioassay formats, targets, detection methods and endpoints.",
   "fsrCategory": "https://w3id.org/fair/fip/terms/FAIR-Enabling-Resource"
  },
