   "note": "Added from the FAIRsharing Toxicology collection on 2026-10-05. Research 5 Oct 2026 (high confidence): Added from the FAIRsharing Toxicology collection on 2026-10-05. FAIRsharing year 2020 confirmed and refined: 0.4-RELEASE, which the profile calls its first release, has version_date 2020-04-07 in the Bioschemas site source. Earlier public drafts: 0.1-DRAFT-2018_12_07, 0.2-DRAFT-2019_06_11 and 0.3-DRAFT-2019_11_11. A 0.5-DRAFT is in progress. Use 2018-12-07 if the first draft should count. Verified 5 Oct 2026: datePublished changed (The earliest public availability is the first public draft, 0.1-DRAFT-2018_12_07. It is still served at https://bioschemas.org/profiles/ChemicalSubstance/0.1-DRAFT-2018_12_07 ('Version: 07 December 2018'), and the site source gives version_date 20181207. 0.4-RELEASE (2020-04-07) is only the first stable release. The sibling rows bioschemas_dataset_profile, bioschemas_sample_profile and bioschemas_molecularentity are all dated to their first public draft, the first version in the profile's own folder.) Verified 5 Oct 2026: dateSource changed (Source for the first public draft dated 2018-12-07 (see datePublished).) Proposed 9 Oct 2026: Bioschemas profile specifying which schema.org properties describe chemical substance pages, so it defines a metadata schema for substance records.",
