   "fairsharingRecord": "FAIRsharing.r7Kwy7",
   "fairsharingMatch": "confirmed",
   "note": "Added from the FAIRsharing Toxicology collection on 2026-10-05. Research 5 Oct 2026 (high confidence): Added from the FAIRsharing Toxicology collection on 2026-10-05. FAIRsharing gives no year. CAS states that CAS Registry Numbers have identified substances since 1965. The CAS registry system was described in J Chem Doc, Nov 1965 (doi 10.1021/c160019a010), building on Morgan's unique structure description (May 1965, doi 10.1021/c160017a018). The url was changed from the check-digit help page to the CAS REGISTRY page. Registry access is licensed, but the numbers are public and in wide use. Proposed 9 Oct 2026: Identifier scheme in which CAS assigns a unique, check-digited number to each substance, linking names and data across sources.",
   "fsrCategory": "https://w3id.org/fair/fip/terms/FAIR-Enabling-Resource"
  },
