     "relation": "https://w3id.org/fair-tox/dataset#drugmatrix",
     "hadRole": "related_to",
     "evidence": "literature",
     "source": "https://doi.org/10.22427/NTP-DATA-107-022-001-000-3",
     "note": "The complete DrugMatrix database (PostgreSQL dump with histopathology, clinical pathology, in vitro assay and normalised microarray data) is deposited in CEBS under its own DOI; Lea et al. 2017 (doi 10.1093/nar/gkw1077): CEBS guided search gives access to the DrugMatrix toxicogenomic profiles. Proposed by JH on 30 Oct 2026."
    }
   ]
