   "note": "Added from the FAIRsharing Toxicology collection on 2026-10-05. Research 5 Oct 2026 (high confidence): Added from the FAIRsharing Toxicology collection on 2026-10-05. First public release was ChEMBL_01: the web interface and downloads went live on 2009-10-28 (ChEMBL blog; FTP README dated 28/10/2009). This agrees with the FAIRsharing year 2009. The first describing paper, Gaulton et al., NAR, online 2011-09-23 (https://doi.org/10.1093/nar/gkr777), is later. Included through membership of the FAIRsharing Toxicology collection. Proposed 9 Oct 2026: Declared in a FIP for I2, where its stable compound and target identifiers act as controlled vocabulary for metadata.",
