   "note": "Added from the FAIRsharing Toxicology collection on 2026-10-05. Research 5 Oct 2026 (medium confidence): Added from the FAIRsharing Toxicology collection on 2026-10-05. The beta launch in March 2007 comes from Wikipedia, which cites RSC. A Wayback capture of 2007-04-20 shows the live database with news items from 2007-04-10; earlier captures (2003) are a parked domain. The FAIRsharing year 2009 is the RSC acquisition (RSC press release 2009-05-11). The describing paper, Pence & Williams, J Chem Educ 2010 (https://doi.org/10.1021/ed100697w), is later. URL updated to https. Proposed 9 Oct 2026: Chemistry database that aggregates and indexes substance records from hundreds of sources, with links back, so it serves as a domain-specific registry.",
