   "note": "Added from the FAIRsharing Toxicology collection on 2026-10-05. Research 5 Oct 2026 (low confidence): Added from the FAIRsharing Toxicology collection on 2026-10-05. FAIRsharing year 2020 kept: no launch date or paper describing the portal was found. The paper FAIRsharing cites (VonHandorf et al., Epigenetics 2018, doi 10.1080/15592294.2018.1454243) reports the underlying datasets, not the portal. Earliest archive capture is 2021-03-04. FAIRsharing deprecated the record on 2026-06-04 for lack of maintenance. The static page still loads, so it is marked discontinued as unmaintained. Proposed 9 Oct 2026: A small portal that indexes and serves chromium epigenomics datasets with curated metadata, publishing primary records at the data generation stage.",
