   "url": "https://doi.org/10.3390/ph14030237",
   "description": "ToxHub, the knowledge hub of the IMI2 eTRANSAFE project. It was a cloud platform that combined legacy preclinical study data (converted to SEND), clinical safety data and predictive models for translational drug-safety assessment, and only project partners could use it.",
