   "manuscriptEvidence": "III Regulatory; reference notes; L188, L192",
   "mentionedIn": [
    "Whitepaper"
   ],
   "note": "Research 5 Oct 2026 (high confidence): F1000Research v1 published 2022-03-07 (Crossref, Europe PMC); it presents the reproducibility, FAIR data-sharing and model-verification guidelines. No earlier public deliverable found in DataCite. Maintained set to discontinued: the IMI2 project has ended and etransafe.eu now shows a domain-reseller page (2026-10-05). Added 'computational and predictive toxicology' because of the model-verification guidelines. FAIRsharing: no DOI-bearing record found via DataCite; records without a DOI not checked. Proposed 9 Oct 2026: Project guidelines setting conventions for FAIR sharing of drug-safety data and verification of predictive models, applied when integrating data and building models.",
