   "fairsharingMatch": "no record",
   "note": "Research 5 Oct 2026 (medium confidence): Corrected from 2023. The ALTEX paper (doi 10.14573/altex.2307131, online 2023-08-01) only says that work on an AOP FIP had started within PARC. The 'Reference Adverse Outcome Pathways FIP' v0.0.1 was first published as a nanopublication on 2025-07-14, from FIP Wizard project 3f1ebb12 and declared by the FAIR-AOPs community. The old url pointed to FIP Wizard project 2f1c0e80 ('Adverse Outcome Pathways FIP'), the draft it was copied from (edits January 2023 to December 2024), which was never nanopublished. The url now points to the published FIP. FAIRsharing: no record. Proposed 9 Oct 2026: Community-agreed list of recommended FAIR-enabling resources per FAIR principle for AOPs, which is a reference FAIR Implementation Profile. Checked 30 Oct 2026 (MM): the declaring FAIR-AOPs community (row fairaop_cluster; its nanopublication says it was initiated in the CIAO project) is not a PARC community, so this FIP is not listed in the PARC space https://w3id.org/spaces/parc, which shows only FIPs of PARC communities. Gerhard Burger suggested listing it there.",
