   "manuscript": "named",
   "manuscriptEvidence": "III Data generation; L99",
   "fairsharingRecord": "FAIRsharing.yhLgTV",
   "fairsharingMatch": "confirmed",
   "note": "Research 5 Oct 2026 (medium confidence): The first ISA-API release, v0.1 (GitHub release and PyPI isatools 0.1.0, 2016-02-29), already contained the ISA-JSON code (isajson.py, isatab2json, JSON validation). The schemas were developed openly on GitHub during 2015. The formal description came later: ISA API paper, GigaScience, 2021-09-16 (doi:10.1093/gigascience/giab060). The FAIRsharing record 'Investigation Study Assay JSON' (FAIRsharing.yhLgTV, Standard/model_and_format, year 2017) was found through DataCite and confirmed with one lookup. The ISA-API is still released (v0.14.x; commits in 2026). Verified 5 Oct 2026: fairsharingMatch changed (One JSON lookup of https://fairsharing.org/FAIRsharing.yhLgTV returns 'Investigation Study Assay JSON' (ISA-JSON), Standard/model_and_format, status ready. Its homepage https://isa-specs.readthedocs.io/en/latest/isajson.html is identical to the row's URL.) Proposed 9 Oct 2026: JSON schemas serialising the ISA model of study design, samples, protocols and data files, a machine-actionable metadata schema.",
