   "fairsharingMatch": "no record",
   "note": "Research 5 Oct 2026 (high confidence): Corrected from 2007. 2007 is IUCLID 5, made public in June 2007; IUCLID 6 followed on 2016-04-29. The official IUCLID website (archived 2009) dates the first version to 1993, built for the Existing Substances Regulation 793/93/EEC. The first journal description is Heidorn et al. 2003 (doi 10.1021/ci0202786). If the row means IUCLID 6 only, use 2016-04-29. ECHA pages refuse automated requests (HTTP 403), so the homepage could not be checked by script. FAIRsharing: no record. Proposed 9 Oct 2026: Software for entering and validating chemical data in OECD Harmonised Templates, required when regulatory dossiers are compiled, submitted and assessed.",
