     "note": "Checked 5 Oct 2026: The official IUCLID site describes IUCLID as the tool for recording, storing, submitting and exchanging chemical data in the OECD Harmonised Templates format. Relabelled 5 Oct 2026 from implements: the first IUCLID release (1993) predates the OECD harmonised templates; later IUCLID versions implement them."
