   "note": "Added from the FAIRsharing Toxicology collection on 2026-10-05. Research 5 Oct 2026 (high confidence): Dalby et al. 1992, J Chem Inf Comput Sci 32(3):244-255, May 1992 issue (Crossref print date; the 2002 online date is the digitisation). Agrees with FAIRsharing year 1992. MDL software used the format before 1992; this paper is its first public specification. The homepage PDF (BIOVIA CTfile formats, 2020) responds. Proposed 9 Oct 2026: A connection-table file format that represents molecular structures in a machine-processable form read by almost all cheminformatics software.",
