   "note": "Research 5 Oct 2026 (high confidence): Le Novère et al., Nat Biotechnol, published online 2005-12-06 (Crossref). FAIRsharing year 2005 agrees. There is no live dedicated homepage: co.mbine.org/standards/miriam returns 404, and the COMBINE standards page lists only MIRIAM URIs. I kept the DOI as URL. The guidelines have not been revised since 2005 but are still applied in BioModels curation, so I kept active (borderline). Proposed 9 Oct 2026: Minimum-information guideline specifying the annotation and attribution metadata required for quantitative biochemical models, hence a metadata schema.",
