   "note": "Research 5 Oct 2026 (high confidence): Published 2024-05-01 (Crossref, Europe PMC); no preprint found. SPARQL endpoint live on 2026-10-05. Creator changed from the author list to the organisation. FAIRsharing: no DOI-bearing record found via DataCite; records without a DOI not checked. Verified 5 Oct 2026: datePublished changed (The RDF itself (nano-mie-aop.nq, 37.7 MB, open access) was released on Zenodo as v1.0 on 2023-06-23 (https://zenodo.org/api/records/8076364); the paper's data-availability section cites this record. A ChemRxiv preprint followed on 2023-07-03 (https://api.crossref.org/works/10.26434/chemrxiv-2023-kjcl6, 'is-preprint-of' 10.1186/s13321-024-00833-0), so the note's 'no preprint found' is wrong. Both come before the 2024-05-01 paper. A NanoSafety Snorql UI was already captured at the endpoint on 2022-06-20, but what it served then could not be verified.) Verified 5 Oct 2026: dateBasis changed (The earliest date is the first public release of the RDF dataset on Zenodo (v1.0, 2023-06-23), not a paper.) Verified 5 Oct 2026: dateSource changed (Zenodo record 'RDF dataset produced in the work Exploring Adverse Outcome Pathways for Nanomaterials with semantic web technologies', v1.0, created 2023-06-23, open access.) Proposed 9 Oct 2026: A database that indexes and serves records under stable identifiers, typed Domain-specific registry as databases are in FIPs.",
