   "note": "Research 5 Oct 2026 (medium confidence): Maier et al. 2023 (doi 10.3389/fphy.2023.1271842) state that the KB became publicly available in 2019, and the FAIRsharing year (2019) agrees, so dateBasis is set to release. URL filled with the KB host ssl.biomax.de/nanocommons (BioXM; archived 2022). On 2026-10-05 it returned HTTP 403 to automated requests, and the FAIRsharing homepage domain nanocommons.eu no longer resolves, so maintained stays unknown. Proposed 9 Oct 2026: Nanosafety knowledge base and repository that receives project datasets and serves them harmonised and searchable, acting from deposit through data integration.",
