   "fairsharingMatch": "no record",
   "note": "Research 5 Oct 2026 (medium confidence): The row had no date. The earliest description is the EUROTOX 2024 abstract P05-32 in Toxicology Letters vol. 399 supplement (Crossref deposit 2024-09-02). Later dates: the web app was archived live on 2024-10-05, an SSRN preprint followed on 2025-08-05 (doi 10.2139/ssrn.5379319), and the Environment International paper went online 2025-12-06 (doi 10.1016/j.envint.2025.109986, January 2026 issue). The 2024 year holds even if abstracts do not count, because the app was public by October 2024. The creator was a citation and is now the organisation (some authors are also at BfR); the url was the DOI and is now the web app. FAIRsharing: no record. Proposed 9 Oct 2026: Web platform and API that semantically annotates PubMed abstracts and searches them to extract mechanistic evidence for AOP development in data integration.",
