   "reviewedBy": "DJ",
   "note": "Co-author addition 29 Oct 2026 (DJ, overview of toxicogenomics data standards). Study data format of early toxicogenomics, used from the MAQC project on and adapted in ISA-Tab by diXa. Research 29 Oct 2026 (medium confidence): the earliest description found is the ArrayTrack update, Xu et al., Human Genomics 2010, online 2010-08-01 (Crossref), which calls it an internally developed CDISC/SEND-compliant data import format; DJ reports use since the MAQC project (2005 onwards), so an earlier source would move the date. No homepage, specification document or FAIRsharing record found; the URL is the paper.",
