   "reviewedBy": "IM",
   "note": "Research 5 Oct 2026 (high confidence): 'SPARQL Query Language for RDF' became a W3C Recommendation on 2008-01-15. Its Working Draft dates from 2004-10-12, which matches FAIRsharing year 2004. SPARQL 1.1 became a Recommendation on 2013-03-21. FAIRsharing record FAIRsharing.87ccfd is the SPARQL 1.1 Overview (model/format). Verified 5 Oct 2026: fairsharingMatch changed (One lookup of https://fairsharing.org/FAIRsharing.87ccfd returns id 1063 'Simple Protocol and RDF Query Language Overview' (SPARQL): model_and_format, homepage http://www.w3.org/TR/sparql11-overview/. This is FAIRsharing's SPARQL record, the same standard as the row.) Proposed 9 Oct 2026: W3C query language and protocol specifying how queries and results are exchanged with RDF endpoints.",
   "fsrCategory": "https://w3id.org/fair/fip/terms/FAIR-Enabling-Resource",
