   "note": "Research 5 Oct 2026 (high confidence): ALTEX 36(4):682-699: accepted 2019-09-30, DOI registered 2019-10-26 (Crossref) and indexed in PubMed 2019-10-29, so online in October 2019. Creator changed from the author list to the organisation (University of Konstanz, within EU-ToxRisk). Added 'in vitro toxicology' because it is a template for cell-based methods. FAIRsharing: no DOI-bearing record found via DataCite; records without a DOI not checked. Proposed 9 Oct 2026: Reporting template capturing method metadata when describing in vitro tests, later used to judge their reliability and relevance in regulatory assessment.",
